{"id":"fc119fbe4ef00e9a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-precipitous-ideal.md","title":"Precipitous Ideal","display":"thm-precipitous-ideal — Precipitous Ideal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-precipitous-ideal","aliases":["58-thm-precipitous-ideal","Precipitous Ideal","Precipitousness"],"display":"thm-precipitous-ideal — Precipitous Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-precipitous-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-precipitous-ideal</span><span>Precipitous Ideal</span><span>Precipitousness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-precipitous-ideal — Precipitous Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>（理想的底集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span>（理想谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B_I\\coloneqq\\{[A]_I:A\\subseteq Z\\land A\\notin I\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B_I\\coloneqq\\{[A]_I:A\\subseteq Z\\land A\\notin I\\}\\)</span>（正集商 forcing）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]_I\\leq[B]_I\\leftrightarrow A\\setminus B\\in I\">\\([A]_I\\leq[B]_I\\leftrightarrow A\\setminus B\\in I\\)</span>（商次序）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot U_I\">\\(\\dot U_I\\)</span>（由 generic quotient filter 诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 上超滤子的典范名称）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ult}(V,\\dot U_I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ult}(V,\\dot U_I)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span>（泛超幂及良基性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S\\)</span>（本文件刻画的二元谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S(I,Z)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(Z))\\land Z\\notin I\\land\n\\mathbf 1_{\\mathbb B_I}\\Vdash_{\\mathbb B_I}\n\\mathrm{WF}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ult}(V,\\dot U_I)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S(I,Z)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(Z))\\land Z\\notin I\\land\n\\mathbf 1_{\\mathbb B_I}\\Vdash_{\\mathbb B_I}\n\\mathrm{WF}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ult}(V,\\dot U_I)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Z\\;\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S(I,Z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Z\\;\\mathrm{Precipitous}_S(I,Z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb B_I\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb B_I\\)</span> 是泛滤子，则诱导超滤子为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_G=\\{A\\subseteq Z:[A]_I\\in G\\}\">\\(U_G=\\{A\\subseteq Z:[A]_I\\in G\\}\\)</span>；泛超幂必须使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_G\">\\(U_G\\)</span>，不能直接把商代数上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 上超滤子。</li>\n<li>饱和理想在标准假设下蕴含 precipitousness，但二者不是同一定义。</li>\n<li>该性质也有理想博弈与递降正集序列的等价刻画。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","hea